 75AS2c  (calculated by evaluators using the computer code RADLST). This        
 75AS3c  value agrees remarkably well with Q(|e)=864.7 keV {I9} (2012Wa38), thus
 75AS4c  confirming the accuracy of the present decay scheme.                   
