 75AS cG $ The data from 2005Ra29 has been used sparingly in                    
 75AS2cG the present evaluation since many values seem to be outliers, which    
 75AS3cG suggests large systematic errors in this study. In addition            
 75AS4cG the authors have many gamma rays which have not been confirmed in      
 75AS5cG other studies; these must be contributed from impurities which         
 75AS6cG have remained unidentified in this work                                
 75AS cG $ The 13 measurements from 1991BaZS are independent results from       
 75AS2cG different laboratories which were performed as part of an IAEA CRP.    
 75AS cG                                                                        
 75AS cG $ Note that in 2005Ra29, 1997Lo10, 1994Mi22, 1994Bh07, uncertainties   
 75AS2cG reported for some of the values are below 1%, which seems unrealistic, 
 75AS3cG in view of systematic uncertainties involved                           
